title Summarizing old history without deleting it

view    "Model's view"
summ    "Summary request"
log     "Event log"
hidden  "Logged, not shown"
size    "Tokens in view" counter 102900

old, recent at view

# The view is rebuilt from the log each step, and it is now past the threshold
pause "Threshold 102,400 tokens; the view holds 102,900."

# The old middle is sent once more, with the template instruction at the end
old -> summ : running "Same beginning as earlier requests, so the provider can reuse its work."

# The summary is recorded as a new message carrying a replace instruction
new summary at summ
summary -> log : done "user/message with surfaceOp replace, startSeq 2, endSeq 57."

# The view now shows the summary where the old range was
together
  summary -> view
  old -> hidden : done
size = 24400

# Nothing was deleted: the old events stay in the log for resume and debugging
pause "The view shrank from 102,900 to about 24,400 tokens."
